+        <h2 id="opvr-title">OPVR · Open Photonic Virtual Reality</h2>
+        <p>The long-term goal is a standalone virtual and mixed reality headset with open hardware, open software and integrated photonic accelerators. The first reference system uses conventional hardware and an open XR runtime. Each optional photonic module must demonstrate value at the system level before headset integration.</p>
